2026-08-06T16:13:17.0875474Z i /tmp/RtmpBOfGB3/duckdb.dev
2026-08-06T16:13:17.0875736Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-08-06T16:13:17.0875896Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-08-06T16:13:17.0876008Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-08-06T16:13:17.0876351Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-08-06T16:13:17.0876707Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-08-06T16:13:17.0876893Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
