2026-08-06T16:13:17.1072657Z +     "manner.\n",
2026-08-06T16:13:17.1072814Z +     "\n",
2026-08-06T16:13:17.1073341Z +     "This is intentional, not an oversight. duckdb has an extensive test suite\n",
